    "name": "all_pairs_gap_sigmoid_scaled",
    "intuition": "Vectorized weighting of all pairs by a sigmoid of the positive gap with configurable sigmoid center and sharpness, clamped to ensure nonnegativity and no per-instance normalization, preserving dense all-pair topology.",
    "implementation_hint": {
      "expects": [
        "objective",
